                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does WhatsApp Business API cost?</h3>
                                        <p>Platform (Wati/Interakt): ₹1K-40K/month. Meta conversation fees: ₹0.35-3.50 per conversation. Setup: ₹50K-2 lakh one-time.</p>
                                        <h3>Which platform is best?</h3>
                                        <p>Wati / Interakt for growth-stage. Twilio for international / custom. AiSensy for budget-constrained SMB.</p>
                                        <h3>Do I need Green Tick verification?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes if selling premium / high-ticket — Green Tick badge increases open + response rates 15-30%. Requires Meta business verification + 4.5+ quality rating.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I send unlimited broadcast messages?</h3>
                                        <p>No — Meta rate-limits marketing conversations per number tier. Utility messages have higher limits than marketing. Follow Meta's messaging tiers strictly.</p>
